        },
        {
          "text": "Mom ate neno ottoro me woro Obaŋa i boma-nono, pien ot woro Obaŋa i kuno en Rwot Obaŋa Won Twer Ducu ikome, kede Atin romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.22",
